{% comment %}
  B2 (GOAL_SCORECARD.md, session 4): GoatCounter page-view tracking --
  the official embed snippet (https://www.goatcounter.com/help/countscript),
  a single async <script> pointed at the user's own GoatCounter site, no
  local JS to write or maintain. Gated on site.goatcounter_code being set
  (_config.yml) so this emits NOTHING on a fresh checkout until that's
  filled in -- never ships a script tag pointed at a placeholder/nonexistent
  subdomain. See analytics/goatcounter_notify.py for B3 (the scheduled
  visit-notification poll, which reads GoatCounter's stats API, not this
  page-view script).
{% endcomment %}
{% if site.goatcounter_code %}
  <script
    data-goatcounter="https://{{ site.goatcounter_code }}.goatcounter.com/count"
    async
    src="//gc.zgo.at/count.js"
  ></script>
{% endif %}
